    <string name="setup_title">Set up access</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">Autospeed works best when it has everything it needs before you start driving. Grant what you want now so Android never interrupts you with a permission request on the road. Only location is required; everything else is optional and only turns off its own feature.</string>
